---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <section class="privacy-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy sets out the rules for collecting, processing, and protecting personal data collected from
          users of the "Recode Software Przemysław Szejna" website for statistical and analytical purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
        <p>The data controller is:</p>
        <address>
          Recode Software Przemysław Szejna<br />
          94-052 Łódź, ul. Popiełuszki 11/20<br />
          +48 732 049 610<br />
          przemyslaw.szejna@recode-software.eu
        </address>

        <h2>2. Purposes of Data Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Personal data of users are collected for statistical and analytical purposes, specifically to monitor website
          traffic, gather information about visitors, and analyze how our website is used. We use the Google Analytics
          tool to collect this data.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Types of Data Collected</h2>
        <p>When visiting our website, we may collect the following personal data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>IP addresses</li>
          <li>Browser type and operating system</li>
          <li>Referral source</li>
          <li>Pages visited within our website</li>
          <li>Time spent on our website</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may use cookies to improve the quality of our services and analyze website traffic. Cookies are
          small text files stored on the user's device. Users have the option to manage cookie settings in their browser.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not share collected personal data with third parties. This data is used solely for statistical and
          analytical purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>6. User Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Users of our website are not required to provide their personal data. You have the right to access and delete
          your data at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns regarding our Privacy Policy, please contact us using the contact
          information provided above.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .privacy-page {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 3rem;

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      padding: 2rem;
    }
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  address {
    font-style: normal;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 2;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;

    li {
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;

      &::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: 0.6em;
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        background: var(--primary-color);
        border-radius: 2px;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
